data.content:
## What Changed

Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi 10.0 upgrades to **Microsoft.OpenApi v2**, which targets OpenAPI 3.1. Key breaking changes:

### 1. `Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` types removed
`OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. are gone. Use `System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonNode` instead.

### 2. `Schema.Example` → use `JsonNode`
The property now accepts `JsonNode` rather than `IOpenApiAny`.

### 3. `Schema.Nullable` removed
OpenAPI 3.1 expresses nullable via the `Type` flags enum, not a boolean property.

### 4. `OpenApiSecurityRequirement` is no longer a dictionary
It's now a plain object with a `Schemes` dictionary property.

### 5. `OpenApiReference` constructor changed
Uses a constructor with `(id, type)` parameters instead of property initializers.

---

## Fixed Code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecurityScheme
    {
        Reference = new OpenApiReference("oauth2", ReferenceType.SecurityScheme)
    };
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { Schemes = new Dictionary<OpenApiSecurityScheme, IList<string>>
            {
                [oAuthScheme] = scopes
            }
        }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
            {
                // In OpenAPI 3.1, remove "null" from the type flags instead of setting Nullable
                property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
            }
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

### Summary of replacements

| .NET 9 (OpenApi v1) | .NET 10 (OpenApi v2) |
|---|---|
| `using Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` | `using System.Text.Json.Nodes` |
| `new OpenApiString("1.0")` | `JsonValue.Create("1.0")` |
| `new OpenApiReference { Type = ..., Id = ... }` | `new OpenApiReference("id", ReferenceType.X)` |
| `new() { [scheme] = scopes }` | `new() { Schemes = new Dictionary<...> { [scheme] = scopes } }` |
| `property.Value.Nullable = false` | `property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null` |
